+PREREQ — Red (VENGEANCE) must be up first
+══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
+Ask Red to confirm before you proceed:
+  • s&box editor open (currently vanilla party lane: dxrp-vanilla)
+  • chomnr listening :9090 (editor bottom-right: green MCP pill)
+  • Claude Bridge IPC heartbeat present
+
+Red refresh (if anything is red on Red):
+  cd C:\Users\jared\Projects\lifepunch
+  powershell -File lifepunch\scripts\Install-CornermanSboxBridgeMcp.ps1
+  powershell -File lifepunch\scripts\Connect-CornermanBridge.ps1 -SkipLmWarm
+  powershell -File lifepunch\scripts\Start-VengeanceEditorTunnelToCornerman.ps1 -Background
+
+══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
