+══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
+cd C:\Projects\lifepunch
+git fetch origin
+git checkout checkpoint-lpbitcoin-pre-sleep-20260701
+git pull --rebase
+
+══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
+STEP 1 — Map SMB bridge (once per reboot; MUST be interactive desktop)
+══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
+powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File C:\lifepunch\cornerman\Map-CornermanBridgeShare.ps1
+
+Verify:
+  Test-Path \\VENGEANCE\SboxBridgeIpc\status.json
+Expected: True
+
+If False:
+  • Map failed (error 86/1326) → tell Bloodwave; lpbridge password on Red, not Windows Hello PIN
+  • Share missing → tell Red to run Install-CornermanSboxBridgeMcp.ps1 (elevated once for SMB)
+
+Law: sbox MCP MUST use UNC \\VENGEANCE\SboxBridgeIpc — NOT the SSH mirror path
+      C:\lifepunch\cornerman\sbox-bridge-ipc-mirror (fallback/emergency only)
+
+══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
+STEP 2 — Editor MCP tunnel (chomnr :9090 → Red)
+══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
+powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File C:\lifepunch\cornerman\Start-CornermanSboxEditorTunnel.ps1 -Background
+
+Verify tunnel:
+  Get-NetTCPConnection -LocalPort 9090 -State Listen -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue
+
+If tunnel fails (no passwordless SSH Green→Red):
+  • Tell Red to run instead: Start-VengeanceEditorTunnelToCornerman.ps1 -Background
+  • Path B (reverse tunnel from Red) is the common fix when Green cannot SSH to 192.168.1.236
+
+Probe chomnr through tunnel:
+  Invoke-WebRequest -Uri "http://127.0.0.1:9090/sbox-mcp" -Method Post `
+    -ContentType "application/json" `
+    -Body '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"initialize","params":{"protocolVersion":"2025-06-18","capabilities":{},"clientInfo":{"name":"probe","version":"1"}}}' `
+    -TimeoutSec 5 -UseBasicParsing
+Expected: HTTP 200
+
+══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
+STEP 3 — Verify mcp.json (Cornerman)
+══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
+Get-Content $env:USERPROFILE\.cursor\mcp.json -Raw | ConvertFrom-Json |
+  Select-Object -ExpandProperty mcpServers | Format-List
+
+Expected THREE servers:
+
+  sbox
+    command: cmd
+    args: npx -y sbox-mcp-server
+    env.SBOX_BRIDGE_IPC_DIR = \\VENGEANCE\SboxBridgeIpc
+
+  sbox-editor
+    url = http://127.0.0.1:9090/sbox-mcp
+
+  cornerman-lm
+    command: node
+    args: C:\Projects\local-llm-mcp-server\dist\index.js
+
+WRONG if you see:
+  • SBOX_BRIDGE_IPC_DIR pointing at sbox-bridge-ipc-mirror
+  • sbox-jtc or :29015 (Green should not have this)
+  • Missing sbox-editor
+
+Fix: tell Red to re-run Install-CornermanSboxBridgeMcp.ps1, then Reload Window here.
+
+══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
+STEP 4 — Tier-3 LM (local on Green)
